d What to Whom","stamp":"DEPENDENCY PARSING: WHO DID WHAT TO WHOM","topic":""},{"id":"u3-03","number":13,"name":"Transition-Based Parsing: Building Trees Step by Step","stamp":"TRANSITION-BASED PARSING: BUILDING TREES STEP BY STEP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-01","number":14,"name":"Word Vectors: Giving Words a Place on a Map","stamp":"WORD VECTORS: GIVING WORDS A PLACE ON A MAP","topic":""},{"id":"u4-02","number":15,"name":"Word2Vec: Learning Word Vectors from Context","stamp":"WORD2VEC: LEARNING WORD VECTORS FROM CONTEXT","topic":""},{"id":"u4-03","number":16,"name":"Recurrent Neural Networks: Reading with Memory","stamp":"RECURRENT NEURAL NETWORKS: READING WITH MEMORY","topic":""},{"id":"u4-04","number":17,"name":"LSTMs: Remembering What Matters","stamp":"LSTMS: REMEMBERING WHAT MATTERS","topic":""},{"id":"u5-01","number":18,"name":"Contextual Embeddings and ELMo","stamp":"CONTEXTUAL EMBEDDINGS AND ELMO","topic":""},{"id":"u5-02","number":19,"name":"BERT: Reading in Both Directions","stamp":"BERT: READING IN BOTH DIRECTIONS","topic":""}]},"stop":{"number":19,"name":"BERT: Reading in Both Directions","stamp":"BERT: READING IN BOTH DIRECTIONS"},"shorts":{"width":1080,"height":1920,"maxSeconds":60,"cta":"Full lesson: NLP, Simply Explained · Unit 5"},"thumbnail":{"headline":"How BERT learned language","big":"[MASK]"},"segments":[{"id":"intro","kind":"intro","component":"TitleCard","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c01","start":0.6,"end":7.264,"marks":{},"text":"Welcome back to NLP, Simply Explained. This is unit 5, lesson 2, our final lesson: BERT.","words":[{"w":"Welcome","start":0.6},{"w":"back","start":1.08},{"w":"to","start":1.427},{"w":"NLP,","start":1.773},{"w":"Simply","start":2.12},{"w":"Explained.","start":2.76},{"w":"This","start":3.56},{"w":"is","start":3.88},{"w":"unit","start":4.08},{"w":"5,","start":4.467},{"w":"lesson","start":4.853},{"w":"2,","start":5.24},{"w":"our","start":5.48},{"w":"final","start":5.926},{"w":"lesson:","start":6.372},{"w":"BERT.","start":6.818}]},{"id":"c02","start":7.664,"end":14.92,"marks":{},"text":"ELMo showed that pretraining on plain text pays off. BERT took that idea and changed NLP almost overnight.","words":[{"w":"ELMo","start":7.664},{"w":"showed","start":8.064},{"w":"that","start":8.384},{"w":"pretraining","start":8.504},{"w":"on","start":9.024},{"w":"plain","start":9.184},{"w":"text","start":9.504},{"w":"pays","start":9.944},{"w":"off.","start":10.304},{"w":"BERT","start":10.784},{"w":"took","start":11.264},{"w":"that","start":11.504},{"w":"idea","start":11.704},{"w":"and","start":12.224},{"w":"changed","start":12.744},{"w":"NLP","start":13.264},{"w":"almost","start":13.784},{"w":"overnight.","start":14.264}]}],"title":"Welcome","shortTitle":"Welcome","props":{"kicker":"Unit 5 · Lesson 2","title":"BERT","subtitle":"Reading in both directions"},"start":0.6,"end":14.92,"startFrame":0,"durationInFrames":475},{"id":"idea","kind":"core","component":"BigIdea","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c03","start":15.833,"end":23.689,"marks":{},"text":"Here's the idea. BERT learned language by filling in blanks, millions and millions of times, reading in both directions at once.","words":[{"w":"Here's","start":15.833},{"w":"the","start":16.193},{"w":"idea.","start":16.393},{"w":"BERT","start":17.113},{"w":"learned","start":17.593},{"w":"language","start":17.953},{"w":"by","start":18.433},{"w":"filling","start":18.593},{"w":"in","start":18.953},{"w":"blanks,","start":19.113},{"w":"millions","start":19.673},{"w":"and","start":20.233},{"w":"millions","start":20.393},{"w":"of","start":20.873},{"w":"times,","start":21.033},{"w":"reading","start":21.593},{"w":"in","start":22.033},{"w":"both","start":22.193},{"w":"directions","start":22.473},{"w":"at","start":23.113},{"w":"once.","start":23.313}]}],"title":"The big idea","shortTitle":"The big idea","props":{"kicker":"Key idea","text":"BERT learned language by filling in blanks, reading both directions at once.","highlight":["blanks,"]},"start":15.833,"end":23.689,"startFrame":475,"durationInFrames":263},{"id":"bert","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c04","start":24.6,"end":36.313,"marks":{},"text":"BERT, from 2018, stands for bidirectional encoder representations from transformers. It's a model pretrained on lots of text, to understand every word in its full context.","words":[{"w":"BERT,","start":24.6},{"w":"from","start":25},{"w":"2018,","start":25.2},{"w":"stands","start":26.6},{"w":"for","start":27.04},{"w":"bidirectional","start":27.4},{"w":"encoder","start":27.96},{"w":"representations","start":28.52},{"w":"from","start":29.52},{"w":"transformers.","start":29.72},{"w":"It's","start":30.76},{"w":"a","start":31.16},{"w":"model","start":31.52},{"w":"pretrained","start":31.88},{"w":"on","start":32.24},{"w":"lots","start":32.48},{"w":"of","start":32.8},{"w":"text,","start":32.96},{"w":"to","start":33.48},{"w":"understand","start":33.72},{"w":"every","start":34.36},{"w":"word","start":34.64},{"w":"in","start":34.92},{"w":"its","start":35.12},{"w":"full","start":35.36},{"w":"context.","start":35.64}]},{"id":"c05","start":36.713,"end":40.277,"marks":{},"text":"Show it \"she sat on the blank of the river\", and it fills in: bank.","words":[{"w":"Show","start":36.713},{"w":"it","start":36.953},{"w":"\"she","start":37.193},{"w":"sat","start":37.353},{"w":"on","start":37.593},{"w":"the","start":37.673},{"w":"blank","start":37.753},{"w":"of","start":38.033},{"w":"the","start":38.153},{"w":"river\",","start":38.273},{"w":"and","start":38.593},{"w":"it","start":38.753},{"w":"fills","start":38.913},{"w":"in:","start":39.313},{"w":"bank.","start":39.753}]},{"id":"c06","start":40.677,"end":48.374,"marks":{},"text":"Think of a student who has done millions of fill-in-the-blank exercises, and only then specialises for one particular exam.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":40.677},{"w":"of","start":40.877},{"w":"a","start":40.997},{"w":"student","start":41.117},{"w":"who","start":41.637},{"w":"has","start":41.837},{"w":"done","start":42.037},{"w":"millions","start":42.317},{"w":"of","start":42.837},{"w":"fill-in-the-blank","start":43.417},{"w":"exercises,","start":43.997},{"w":"and","start":45.077},{"w":"only","start":45.317},{"w":"then","start":45.637},{"w":"specialises","start":45.957},{"w":"for","start":46.797},{"w":"one","start":46.997},{"w":"particular","start":47.237},{"w":"exam.","start":47.877}]}],"title":"What is BERT?","shortTitle":"What is BERT?","props":{"kicker":"2018","term":"BERT","definition":"Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers: a model pretrained on lots of text to understand each word in its full context.","example":"she sat on the [MASK] of the river → bank","analogy":"A student who did millions of fill-in-the-blank exercises, then specialises for one exam."},"start":24.6,"end":48.374,"startFrame":738,"durationInFrames":741},{"id":"attention","kind":"core","component":"Definition","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c07","start":49.3,"end":59.53,"marks":{},"text":"BERT is built from a Transformer, and its key ingredient is self-attention. Every word looks at every other word in the sentence, and decides which ones matter for its meaning.","words":[{"w":"BERT","start":49.48},{"w":"is","start":49.66},{"w":"built","start":49.82},{"w":"from","start":50.14},{"w":"a","start":50.26},{"w":"Transformer,","start":50.42},{"w":"and","start":51.22},{"w":"its","start":51.38},{"w":"key","start":51.807},{"w":"ingredient","start":52.233},{"w":"is","start":52.66},{"w":"self-attention.","start":53.38},{"w":"Every","start":54.1},{"w":"word","start":54.54},{"w":"looks","start":54.86},{"w":"at","start":55.14},{"w":"every","start":55.38},{"w":"other","start":55.62},{"w":"word","start":55.86},{"w":"in","start":56.1},{"w":"the","start":56.26},{"w":"sentence,","start":56.42},{"w":"and","start":56.98},{"w":"decides","start":57.22},{"w":"which","start":57.86},{"w":"ones","start":58.06},{"w":"matter","start":58.38},{"w":"for","start":58.66},{"w":"its","start":58.86},{"w":"meaning.","start":59.1}]},{"id":"c08","start":59.93,"end":67.906,"marks":{},"text":"In \"the cat drank the milk because it was hungry\", the word \"it\" pays most attention to \"cat\", because hungry things are cats, not milk.","words":[{"w":"In","start":59.93},{"w":"\"the","start":60.09},{"w":"cat","start":60.25},{"w":"drank","start":60.53},{"w":"the","start":60.89},{"w":"milk","start":61.01},{"w":"because","start":61.37},{"w":"it","start":61.61},{"w":"was","start":61.73},{"w":"hungry\",","start":61.93},{"w":"the","start":62.57},{"w":"word","start":62.81},{"w":"\"it\"","start":63.13},{"w":"pays","start":63.37},{"w":"most","start":63.77},{"w":"attention","start":64.01},{"w":"to","start":64.57},{"w":"\"cat\",","start":64.81},{"w":"because","start":65.29},{"w":"hungry","start":65.61},{"w":"things","start":66.09},{"w":"are","start":66.41},{"w":"cats,","start":66.61},{"w":"not","start":67.13},{"w":"milk.","start":67.45}]},{"id":"c09","start":68.306,"end":73.409,"marks":{},"text":"Think of a meeting where each person listens most closely to the people who are relevant to them.","words":[{"w":"Think","start":68.306},{"w":"of","start":68.506},{"w":"a","start":68.626},{"w":"meeting","start":68.746},{"w":"where","start":69.186},{"w":"each","start":69.426},{"w":"person","start":69.746},{"w":"listens","start":70.146},{"w":"most","start":70.786},{"w":"closely","start":71.106},{"w":"to","start":71.586},{"w":"the","start":71.706},{"w":"people","start":71.826},{"w":"who","start":72.146},{"w":"are","start":72.306},{"w":"relevant","start":72.506},{"w":"to","start":73.026},{"w":"them.","start":73.146}]}],"title":"Self-attention","shortTitle":"Self-attention","props":{"kicker":"Inside the Transformer","term":"Self-attention","definition":"Every word looks at every other word in the sentence, and decides which ones matter for its meaning.","example":"The cat drank the milk because it was hungry: it → cat","analogy":"In a meeting, each person listens most closely to the people relevant to them."},"start":49.3,"end":73.409,"startFrame":1479,"durationInFrames":751},{"id":"pretrain","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c10","start":74.333,"end":78.699,"marks":{},"text":"BERT was pretrained with two simple games, played on books and Wikipedia.","words":[{"w":"BERT","start":74.333},{"w":"was","start":74.693},{"w":"pretrained","start":75.053},{"w":"with","start":75.413},{"w":"two","start":75.573},{"w":"simple","start":75.813},{"w":"games,","start":76.253},{"w":"played","start":76.813},{"w":"on","start":77.173},{"w":"books","start":77.373},{"w":"and","start":77.633},{"w":"Wikipedia.","start":77.893}]},{"id":"c11","start":79.099,"end":82.687,"marks":{},"text":"Mask: hide about fifteen percent of the words in each passage.","words":[{"w":"Mask:","start":79.099},{"w":"hide","start":79.739},{"w":"about","start":80.099},{"w":"fifteen","start":80.339},{"w":"percent","start":80.719},{"w":"of","start":81.099},{"w":"the","start":81.219},{"w":"words","start":81.339},{"w":"in","start":81.659},{"w":"each","start":81.819},{"w":"passage.","start":82.139}]},{"id":"c12","start":83.087,"end":89.167,"marks":{},"text":"Predict: guess the hidden words, using the words on both sides. This is called a masked language model.","words":[{"w":"Predict:","start":83.087},{"w":"guess","start":83.607},{"w":"the","start":83.927},{"w":"hidden","start":84.087},{"w":"words,","start":84.487},{"w":"using","start":84.927},{"w":"the","start":85.207},{"w":"words","start":85.407},{"w":"on","start":85.727},{"w":"both","start":86.1},{"w":"sides.","start":86.474},{"w":"This","start":86.847},{"w":"is","start":87.087},{"w":"called","start":87.327},{"w":"a","start":87.687},{"w":"masked","start":87.847},{"w":"language","start":88.287},{"w":"model.","start":88.727}]},{"id":"c13","start":89.567,"end":94.732,"marks":{},"text":"Next sentence: given two sentences, guess whether the second really follows the first.","words":[{"w":"Next","start":89.567},{"w":"sentence:","start":89.967},{"w":"given","start":90.687},{"w":"two","start":91.127},{"w":"sentences,","start":91.367},{"w":"guess","start":92.087},{"w":"whether","start":92.447},{"w":"the","start":92.687},{"w":"second","start":92.847},{"w":"really","start":93.247},{"w":"follows","start":93.687},{"w":"the","start":94.127},{"w":"first.","start":94.327}]}],"title":"How BERT was pretrained","shortTitle":"How BERT was pretrained","props":{"kicker":"Pretraining","title":"How BERT learned from plain text","steps":[{"label":"Mask","detail":"hide about 15% of the words"},{"label":"Predict","detail":"guess them from both sides"},{"label":"Next sentence","detail":"does sentence B follow A?"}]},"start":74.333,"end":94.732,"startFrame":2230,"durationInFrames":639},{"id":"masked","kind":"core","component":"Table","short":true,"cues":[{"id":"c14","start":95.633,"end":97.537,"marks":{},"text":"Here are some blanks BERT might fill in.","words":[{"w":"Here","start":95.633},{"w":"are","start":95.813},{"w":"some","start":95.993},{"w":"blanks","start":96.153},{"w":"BERT","start":96.513},{"w":"might","start":96.873},{"w":"fill","start":97.073},{"w":"in.","start":97.273}]},{"id":"c15","start":97.937,"end":100.285,"marks":{},"text":"\"The cat sat on the blank\": probably mat.","words":[{"w":"\"The","start":97.937},{"w":"cat","start":98.057},{"w":"sat","start":98.337},{"w":"on","start":98.617},{"w":"the","start":98.697},{"w":"blank\":","start":98.817},{"w":"probably","start":99.257},{"w":"mat.","start":99.857}]},{"id":"c16","start":100.685,"end":103.184,"marks":{},"text":"\"I drank a cup of blank\": tea, or coffee.","words":[{"w":"\"I","start":100.685},{"w":"drank","start":100.805},{"w":"a","start":101.125},{"w":"cup","start":101.205},{"w":"of","start":101.445},{"w":"blank\":","start":101.565},{"w":"tea,","start":102.085},{"w":"or","start":102.365},{"w":"coffee.","start":102.645}]},{"id":"c17","start":103.584,"end":112.268,"marks":{},"text":"\"Paris is the capital of blank\": France. Filling in blanks like these, it picks up grammar, meaning, and a surprising amount of world knowledge.","words":[{"w":"\"Paris","start":103.584},{"w":"is","start":104.024},{"w":"the","start":104.184},{"w":"capital","start":104.304},{"w":"of","start":104.784},{"w":"blank\":","start":105.371},{"w":"France.","start":105.957},{"w":"Filling","start":106.544},{"w":"in","start":106.944},{"w":"blanks","start":107.144},{"w":"like","start":107.584},{"w":"these,","start":107.824},{"w":"it","start":108.184},{"w":"picks","start":108.384},{"w":"up","start":108.704},{"w":"grammar,","start":108.944},{"w":"meaning,","start":109.504},{"w":"and","start":109.904},{"w":"a","start":110.104},{"w":"surprising","start":110.224},{"w":"amount","start":110.824},{"w":"of","start":111.224},{"w":"world","start":111.384},{"w":"knowledge.","start":111.744}]}],"title":"Filling in the blanks","shortTitle":"How BERT learned by filling in blanks","props":{"kicker":"Masked words","title":"What BERT guesses for [MASK]","columns":["Input","Likely guess"],"rows":[["The cat sat on the [MASK].","mat"],["I drank a cup of [MASK].","tea · coffee"],["Paris is the capital of [MASK].","France"]],"highlight":[{"row":2,"col":1}]},"start":95.633,"end":112.268,"startFrame":2869,"durationInFrames":527},{"id":"finetune","kind":"core","component":"Steps","short":false,"cues":[{"id":"c18","start":113.2,"end":115.961,"marks":{},"text":"How do you use BERT for your own task? Four steps.","words":[{"w":"How","start":113.2},{"w":"do","start":113.28},{"w":"you","start":113.44},{"w":"use","start":113.6},{"w":"BERT","start":113.8},{"w":"for","start":114.04},{"w":"your","start":114.2},{"w":"own","start":114.32},{"w":"task?","start":114.56},{"w":"Four","start":115.04},{"w":"steps.","start":115.36}]},{"id":"c19","start":116.361,"end":120.268,"marks":{},"text":"Pretrain once: this expensive part has already been done for you.","words":[{"w":"Pretrain","start":116.601},{"w":"once:","start":116.841},{"w":"this","start":117.521},{"w":"expensive","start":117.8